<title>ESTONIA: TRADE IN PENNU TO RESTART.</title>
<headline>TRADE IN PENNU TO RESTART.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange said it will restart trade in Pennu shares on Thursday, which were suspended due to a news conference.</p>
<p>Pennu had a news conference on Wednesday to announce that it and Western Digital had in principle agreed to launch a hard disk repair factory.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
